  "bio": "Rex, a talented tattoo artist based in Lisbon, Portugal, is highly proficient in fineline and dotwork styles. With accolades such as the Lanzendorf-National Geographic PaleoArt Prize in 2021 and a Master's degree in Drawing, this artist's skill level speaks for itself, creating intricate and scientifically accurate designs.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Lisbon, Portugal\n\nTattoo artist in @covenant.lisboa \nLanzendorf-National Geographic PaleoArt Prize Winner\nMaster's in Scientific Illustration\nMaster’s in Paleontology",
